Package: pitexplorer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         cockpit-bridge (>= 314),
         cockpit-ws (>= 314),
Description: file browser for Cockpit
 PitExplorer adds a Files page to the Cockpit web console: shortcuts and
 mounted file systems in a sidebar, grid and list views, and uploading,
 downloading, renaming, moving and deleting files and folders.
 .
 All access goes through the Cockpit session with the rights of the
 logged-in user. PitExplorer runs no daemon and opens no network port.
